<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ kiosk_language }}">
<!-- Jinja2 template <site>/templates/homepage-browser.html.j2 (profile "browser").
     Local home page of the public computers: search first, four task tiles,
     help and USB in the footer. Flat design in the site colours; the minutes
     come from idle_seconds. Must fit without scrolling below the bar and the
     Firefox toolbars: about 1920x925 (1080p) down to 1366x613 (768p). -->
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ kiosk_brand_name }} — Public computer</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --accent: {{ color_accent }}; --ink: #111; --muted: #5c5c5c; --paper: #f4f4f2;
    --tile-a: {{ color_accent }}; --tile-b: #4C6EF5; --tile-c: #7048E8; --tile-d: #E8590C;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: {{ kiosk_css_font_family }};
    color: var(--ink); background: #fff;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100%;
  }
  .wrap { width: min(1500px, 100% - 2 * clamp(28px, 5vw, 96px)); margin: 0 auto; }

  header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding-top: clamp(22px, 4vh, 48px); }
  header .logo { width: clamp(60px, 9vh, 110px); }
  .notice { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; max-width: 36rem; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(15px, 2.1vh, 20px); line-height: 1.35; color: #222; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 6px 0 6px 14px; }
  .notice svg { flex: none; }
  main.wrap { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; padding: clamp(18px, 6vh, 72px) 0 clamp(12px, 3vh, 40px); }

  h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 8.4vh, 96px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; margin: 0; }
  h1 span { color: var(--accent); }

  .searchrow { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin: clamp(18px, 4.2vh, 48px) 0 0; max-width: 1240px; }
  form.search { flex: 1; display: flex; border: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  form.search label { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
  form.search input[name=search] { flex: 1; min-width: 0; border: 0; font: inherit; font-size: clamp(18px, 2.6vh, 26px); padding: clamp(12px, 2vh, 20px) 22px; outline: none; }
  form.search button { border: 0; background: var(--ink); color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vh, 22px); padding: 0 clamp(18px, 2vw, 34px); display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
  .catlink { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 28px); border: 2px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; font-size: clamp(15px, 2.1vh, 21px); }
  .catlink:hover { background: var(--paper); }
  .search-hint { margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vh, 15px); }

  .tasks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: clamp(12px, 1.5vw, 24px); margin: clamp(22px, 5vh, 60px) 0 0; }
  .tasks a { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; gap: clamp(14px, 3vh, 34px); min-height: clamp(120px, 24vh, 260px); padding: clamp(16px, 2.5vh, 28px); background: var(--paper); color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-top: 8px solid var(--c); }
  .tasks a:hover { background: #ebebe7; }
  .tasks svg { width: clamp(36px, 5vh, 52px); height: clamp(36px, 5vh, 52px); color: var(--c); }
  .tasks strong { display: block; font-size: clamp(20px, 3.4vh, 36px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; }
  .tasks small { display: block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vh, 17px); color: var(--muted); }

  footer { margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0dc; }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 32px; align-items: center; padding: clamp(12px, 2.2vh, 22px) 0; }
  footer a { display: inline-flex; gap: 9px; align-items: center; color: inherit; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: clamp(15px, 1.9vh, 18px); }
  footer a svg { color: var(--accent); }
  footer .url { margin-left: auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vh, 15px); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <img class="logo" src="assets/{{ kiosk_logo }}" alt="{{ kiosk_brand_name }}">
    <p class="notice">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{ color_accent }}" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
      <span>Public computer: everything is deleted after {{ (idle_seconds / 60) | int }} minutes without input. Save your files to a USB drive.</span>
    </p>
  </header>
</div>

<main class="wrap">
  <h1>Welcome to the <span>library</span></h1>

  <div class="searchrow">
    <form class="search" action="https://www.wikipedia.org/w/index.php" method="get">
      <label for="q">Search</label>
      <input id="q" name="search" placeholder="Search — e.g. Johann Sebastian Bach" autocomplete="off" autofocus>
      <button type="submit"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="M20 20l-4-4"/></svg>Search</button>
    </form>
    <a class="catlink" href="https://example.org/catalogue">Open the catalogue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <p class="search-hint">The demo search queries Wikipedia. Point the form at your own catalogue in templates/homepage-browser.html.j2.</p>

  <nav class="tasks">
    <a href="https://booking.example.org" style="--c: var(--tile-a)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16"/><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"/></svg>
      <span><strong>Book a room</strong><small>booking.example.org</small></span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://cloud.example.org" style="--c: var(--tile-b)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M7 18h10a4 4 0 0 0 .5-8 6 6 0 0 0-11.5 1.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 7 18z"/></svg>
      <span><strong>Open files</strong><small>Cloud storage</small></span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://www.gutenberg.org/" style="--c: var(--tile-c)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 4h7v16H4zM13 4h7v16h-7z"/><path d="M7 8h1M16 8h1"/></svg>
      <span><strong>E-books</strong><small>Project Gutenberg</small></span>
    </a>
    <a href="https://example.org" style="--c: var(--tile-d)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c3 3.5 3 14.5 0 18M12 3c-3 3.5-3 14.5 0 18"/></svg>
      <span><strong>Website</strong><small>example.org</small></span>
    </a>
  </nav>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="http://127.0.0.1:8080/"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="7" y="9" width="10" height="13"/><path d="M9 9V3h6v6"/></svg>USB drive</a>
    <a href="https://example.org/help"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.5 9.5a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.7.3-1 .9-1 1.7M12 17h0"/></svg>Help &amp; guides</a>
    <span class="url">{{ kiosk_brand_name }} · profile {{ kiosk_profile }}</span>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
